# Making Headlines (windurst 37) with Lure of the Wildcat (Windurst, group 94) accepted at Kyume-Romeh (Windurst
# Waters): the wildcat's 939 (a Progress event) answers first (its finish: the wildcat bit 14), then his script: this
# quest's 668 (the Windurst Waters Scoop, bit 0), then 669, 669. Both accepted by GM; no New Model Hat.
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-56.0,-4.5,23.2 job=WAR lvl=75
login
quest Windurst.MakingHeadlines accepted
quest Windurst.LureOfTheWildcat accepted
